DevEco CLI (https://gitcode.com/openharmony-sig/deveco-cli), MIT License.

Reused or adapted in deveco-mcp:
- resources/vendor/arkts-check.cjs: vendored unchanged from packages/cli/src/resources/arkts-check.cjs
  (commit 8f69118d993ba363621c00d8fe6762c36f6062d5); run as the warm ArkTS static-check daemon.
- src/domains/sign.ts: Studio/Hvigor signing-material password format and AppGallery Connect
  auto-signing flow (certificate, device, debug profile endpoints) follow packages/cli/src/signature.
- src/domains/ui.ts: screen-recorder toggle protocol follows packages/cli/src/ui/screenrecord.
- src/domains/skills.ts: OpenHarmony skill-market API usage follows packages/cli/src/skills.
- Knowledge packs are built from the @deveco-test/deveco-cli-knowledgebase docs package.

